{"steam_appid":1915380,"steam_name":"Garden Life: A Cozy Simulator","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1915380/665443/d49f9cc92b995b95fd8455256fc710cd943314d1/1750742051/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1708592384","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257002713/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1708592384","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1915380/ss_8bc8e8191878d3f97c17de282116357ef6a47324.1920x1080.jpg?t=1775567867","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1915380/ss_d35030f80cba47cdeef29e15aff755c0f18055a7.1920x1080.jpg?t=1775567867","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1915380/ss_5ce75db4a0ff7bde8abf06bceea9f92578e37ebb.1920x1080.jpg?t=1775567867","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1915380/ss_bd0ebdad58bb406819de6db87d8de87eb2325266.1920x1080.jpg?t=1775567867","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1915380/ss_9764d2d63eb57b1878212e856f895d2aa3cf870b.1920x1080.jpg?t=1775567867"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1915380/extras/5ff6d83a7cffdcf49a8c589dafc579f5.poster.avif?t=1775567867\" width=614 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1915380/extras/5ff6d83a7cffdcf49a8c589dafc579f5.webm?t=1775567867\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1915380/extras/5ff6d83a7cffdcf49a8c589dafc579f5.mp4?t=1775567867\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1915380/extras/964fca75650e3bf8a0cf44fad01abf53.poster.avif?t=1775567867\" width=614 height=80 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1915380/extras/964fca75650e3bf8a0cf44fad01abf53.webm?t=1775567867\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1915380/extras/964fca75650e3bf8a0cf44fad01abf53.mp4?t=1775567867\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1915380/extras/24e4356463851901c344fce7ffd32bc4.poster.avif?t=1775567867\" width=614 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1915380/extras/24e4356463851901c344fce7ffd32bc4.webm?t=1775567867\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1915380/extras/24e4356463851901c344fce7ffd32bc4.mp4?t=1775567867\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>Plant and nurture your dream garden using gardening techniques based in real life and adapted for everyone to enjoy:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Plant seeds, leaving them enough space to thrive<br></li><li> Water, fertilize, and clip your plants to enhance their natural beauty and nurture them to health<br></li><li> Discover different colourful varieties and unlock the full potential of each plant<br></li><li> Pull out all weeds or choose to leave some to protect plants from pests<br></li><li> Admire your plants in full bloom even through the changing seasons : in Garden Life, all plants thrive no matter the time of year!<br></li><li> Play the story mode or the creative mode</li></ul></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1915380/extras/16c2e7c2d94313623ddcac2da9eb3fb4.poster.avif?t=1775567867\" width=614 height=80 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1915380/extras/16c2e7c2d94313623ddcac2da9eb3fb4.webm?t=1775567867\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1915380/extras/16c2e7c2d94313623ddcac2da9eb3fb4.mp4?t=1775567867\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1915380/extras/e8cd0534d4d3e1536ebcbff8e9d72ab6.poster.avif?t=1775567867\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1915380/extras/e8cd0534d4d3e1536ebcbff8e9d72ab6.webm?t=1775567867\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1915380/extras/e8cd0534d4d3e1536ebcbff8e9d72ab6.mp4?t=1775567867\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>You are in charge of an abandoned community garden and decide to roll up your sleeves to restore it to its former glory. Complete tasks given to you by your neighbours to earn rewards, unlock new tools, seeds, ornaments and areas of the garden, and learn more about what lies behind this secluded spot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1915380/extras/bf7bf52f3f2284b4f2e38b7284156811.poster.avif?t=1775567867\" width=614 height=80 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1915380/extras/bf7bf52f3f2284b4f2e38b7284156811.webm?t=1775567867\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1915380/extras/bf7bf52f3f2284b4f2e38b7284156811.mp4?t=1775567867\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1915380/extras/3f93cbf824c72f2da5355e9d1cb6121a.poster.avif?t=1775567867\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1915380/extras/3f93cbf824c72f2da5355e9d1cb6121a.webm?t=1775567867\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1915380/extras/3f93cbf824c72f2da5355e9d1cb6121a.mp4?t=1775567867\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>Instantly unlock every corner of your garden, including all the seeds and ornaments, and give free rein to your creativity: in this restriction-free mode, you can bring your dream designs to life!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1915380/extras/2088dfb26bdf9f06932a26ed35e0a3ad.poster.avif?t=1775567867\" width=614 height=80 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1915380/extras/2088dfb26bdf9f06932a26ed35e0a3ad.webm?t=1775567867\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1915380/extras/2088dfb26bdf9f06932a26ed35e0a3ad.mp4?t=1775567867\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1915380/extras/e649397ec63ff655bffd1972117b722f.poster.avif?t=1775567867\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1915380/extras/e649397ec63ff655bffd1972117b722f.webm?t=1775567867\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1915380/extras/e649397ec63ff655bffd1972117b722f.mp4?t=1775567867\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>Procedural growth simulation developed specifically for the game ensures each plant grows in its own way! Each and every plant grows procedurally, and some even adapt to their environment by climbing if planted close to certain objects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1915380/extras/bcd8e9c7992e980657bc1e4e19221c64.poster.avif?t=1775567867\" width=614 height=80 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1915380/extras/bcd8e9c7992e980657bc1e4e19221c64.webm?t=1775567867\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1915380/extras/bcd8e9c7992e980657bc1e4e19221c64.mp4?t=1775567867\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1915380/extras/a3904c761a4ab9274dd9da0cb4f271a5.poster.avif?t=1775567867\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1915380/extras/a3904c761a4ab9274dd9da0cb4f271a5.webm?t=1775567867\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1915380/extras/a3904c761a4ab9274dd9da0cb4f271a5.mp4?t=1775567867\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>In Garden Life, you are not restricted by a grid: place plants and objects freely to create your designs!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1915380/extras/8c061aff44d74757462d5624c6f01df7.poster.avif?t=1775567867\" width=614 height=80 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1915380/extras/8c061aff44d74757462d5624c6f01df7.webm?t=1775567867\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1915380/extras/8c061aff44d74757462d5624c6f01df7.mp4?t=1775567867\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1915380/extras/c1622062d05dd98e297d9453af56d778.poster.avif?t=1775567867\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1915380/extras/c1622062d05dd98e297d9453af56d778.webm?t=1775567867\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1915380/extras/c1622062d05dd98e297d9453af56d778.mp4?t=1775567867\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>Head to the village square to sell flowers and bouquets at your stall and use the earnings to buy new seeds, ornaments and tools in the shop. You can also donates flowers to help create huge floral sculptures in the pavilion and win adorable prizes! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1915380/extras/e31bbc47a562c4b46610b9c4be57d8a1.poster.avif?t=1775567867\" width=614 height=80 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1915380/extras/e31bbc47a562c4b46610b9c4be57d8a1.webm?t=1775567867\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1915380/extras/e31bbc47a562c4b46610b9c4be57d8a1.mp4?t=1775567867\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1915380/extras/a50d8756d497433ec5cafd0d369cffb3.poster.avif?t=1775567867\" width=614 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1915380/extras/a50d8756d497433ec5cafd0d369cffb3.webm?t=1775567867\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1915380/extras/a50d8756d497433ec5cafd0d369cffb3.mp4?t=1775567867\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br>Add Garden Life to your wishlist, follow us, and join our discord community so you don't miss out on any news!</p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-4790 or AM D Ryzen 5 1400<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 760, 2 GB or AMD Radeon R9 280X, 3 GB<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Graphics cards tests have been ran on desktop versions. Laptop versions of these graphics cards should work, but are not officially supported.</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8600K or AMD Ryzen 5 3600X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce RTX 2080, 8 GB or AMD Radeon RX 6800 XT, 16 GB<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Graphics cards tests have been ran on desktop versions. Laptop versions of these graphics cards should work, but are not officially supported.</li></ul>","genres":["Casual","Simulation"],"developers":["stillalive studios"],"publishers":["Nacon"],"release_date":"22 Feb, 2024"}